CB011039_fail_safe_mode_activation_and_basic_functionality_check
    [Documentation]
    ...  Purpose of this test case is to check basic functionality of fail safe mode activation.
    ...
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  :param int rmod_id: (Mandatory) : RMOD config id of tested radio module, e.g.: 1
    ...  :param str sw_download_path: (Optional) : absolute directory path to download sw package, defaults to /home/ute
    ...  :param str documentation_path - (Optional) full path to custom .csv snapshot documentation, used during snapshot verification,
    ...                                             e.g.: /home/ute/SBTS00_ENB_9999_230609_000006_trbl_log_list.csv
    ...  :param str additional_documentation_path - (Optional) full path to .csv file that extends snapshot documentation by
    ...                                                        additional mandatory files. It's used during snapshot verification.
    ...                                                        File must have the same structure as documentation (same fieldnames and delimiter).
    ...                                                        Example path: /home/ute/custom_mandatory_files.csv

    [Arguments]    ${rmod_id}
    ...            ${sw_download_path}=/home/ute
    ...            ${documentation_path}=${None}
    ...            ${additional_documentation_path}=${None}

    Set test variable                                       ${is_fail_safe_mode_enabled}
    ...                                                     ${False}
    ${bts_type}                                             hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}                                           connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${all_rmods_ids}                                        Get all RMODs index values
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Enable Fail Safe Mode and Reboot RMOD                   rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    Alarms.Allow X2 Link Alarms

    Check Fail Safe Mode Status on RMOD                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Check if Fail Safe Mode Fault is Active in RMOD's Fault History Log
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Create New Snapshot with the Full Coverage              dir_path=${logs_path}
    ...                                                     name=snapshot_fail_safe_mode_enabled.zip

    Run Keyword And Continue On Failure                     Check Content of RMOD Logs in Snapshot
    ...                                                     snapshot_logs_path=${logs_path}
    ...                                                     snapshot_name=snapshot_fail_safe_mode_enabled.zip
    ...                                                     documentation_path=${documentation_path}
    ...                                                     additional_documentation_path=${additional_documentation_path}

    Perform RMOD Reset with Fault Safe Mode Alarms and RMOD Statuses Check
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Update SW Package and Check Statuses of BTS Components when Fail Safe Mode Enabled
    ...                                                     sw_download_path=${sw_download_path}
    ...                                                     rmod_id_with_enabled_fail_safe_mode=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Disable Fail Safe Mode and Reboot RMOD                  rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                             5min
    ...                                                     30sec
    ...                                                     Check Statuses Of RMODs And Their Cells
    ...                                                     rmods=${all_rmods_ids}
    Alarms.Disallow X2 Link Alarms

    [Teardown]  Run keywords                                Robot Log Operation
    ...                                                     Test teardown performing...
    ...         AND                                         Fail Safe Mode Activation Teardown
    ...                                                     is_fail_safe_mode_enabled=${is_fail_safe_mode_enabled}
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...         AND                                         Revert Basic SW Version and Check OnAir
    ...                                                     sw_download_path=${sw_download_path}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

Create New Snapshot with the Full Coverage
    [Arguments]    ${dir_path}
    ...            ${name}
    ...            ${coverage}=Full

    ${sw_version}                                           Get Software Version
    ${credentials}                                          connections.get_http_connection_credentials

    snapshot.setup_snapshot_settings
    ...                                                     snapshot_dir=${dir_path}
    ...                                                     coverage=${coverage}
    ...                                                     sw_version=${sw_version}
    ...                                                     connection_host=${credentials['ip']}
    ...                                                     connection_port=${credentials['port']}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Collecting full coverage snapshot when fault Fail Safe Mode is active...
    Collect snapshot with timing                            snapshot_coverage=${coverage}
    ...                                                     snapshot_dir_path=${dir_path}
    ...                                                     snapshot_name=${name}
    Robot Log Result                                        Snapshot has been collected successfully into ${dir_path}.

Check Content of RMOD Logs in Snapshot
    [Arguments]    ${snapshot_logs_path}
    ...            ${snapshot_name}
    ...            ${documentation_path}=${None}
    ...            ${additional_documentation_path}=${None}

    ${sw_version}                                           Get Software Version
    ${credentials}                                          connections.get_http_connection_credentials

    snapshot.setup_snapshot_settings
    ...                                                     snapshot_dir=${snapshot_logs_path}
    ...                                                     snapshot_file_name=${snapshot_name}
    ...                                                     coverage=Full
    ...                                                     sw_version=${sw_version}
    ...                                                     connection_host=${credentials['ip']}
    ...                                                     connection_port=${credentials['port']}

    ${rus_details}                                          snapshot.get_list_of_all_rus_names
    snapshot.create_mandatory_paths

    FOR  ${ru_details}    IN   @{rus_details}
        Robot Log Operation             Checking if mandatory files are present for ru ${ru_details[0]} (SN: ${ru_details[1]})
        snapshot.collect_mandatory_file_list
        ...                             documentation_path=${documentation_path}
        ...                             additional_documentation_path=${additional_documentation_path}
        ...                             ru_name=${ru_details[0]}
        snapshot.check_if_snapshot_contains_all_mandatory_files
        ...                             ru_name=${ru_details[0]}
        ...                             ru_serial_number=${ru_details[1]}
    END

    snapshot.verify_test_execution

Perform RMOD Reset with Fault Safe Mode Alarms and RMOD Statuses Check
    [Arguments]    ${rmod_id}
    ...            ${bts_type}
    ...            ${connection}

    ${credentials}                                          connections.get_http_connection_credentials
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${bts_host}                                             Set Variable
    ...                                                     ${credentials['ip']}
    ${runtime_rmod_id}                                      admin_info_model.translate_rmod_index_to_runtime
    ...                                                     rmod_index=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Performing reset of RMOD-${rmod_id}...
    admin_info_model.reset_rmod_in_separate_process         connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     runtime_rmod_id=${runtime_rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection_host=${bts_host}
    Robot Log Operation                                     Waiting for RMOD-${rmod_id} offline status...
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                             30sec
    ...                                                     2sec
    ...                                                     status_check.verify_statuses_of_rmod
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     status_variant=offline
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Waiting for fault ID:2934 inactivation...
    ${is_2934_inactive}                                     Alarms.Wait for inactive alarm
    ...                                                     fault_id=2934
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                     timeout=5
    Should be true                                          ${is_2934_inactive}
    ...                                                     msg=Fault with ID:2934 is currently active.
    Robot Log Result                                        Fault with ID:2934 is inactive.

    ${all_rmods_ids}                                        Get all RMODs index values
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Verifying RMODs and Their Cells statuses with impacted RMOD-${rmod_id}...
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                             5min
    ...                                                     30sec
    ...                                                     Verify All RMODs and Their Cells Statuses with Impacted RMOD
    ...                                                     impacted_rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     status_of_impacted_rmod=failed
    ...                                                     status_of_impacted_cells=failed
    ...                                                     all_rmods_ids=${all_rmods_ids}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    Robot Log Result                                        RMODs and Cells statuses validation finished successfully.

    Robot Log Operation                                     Waiting for fault ID:2934 activation...
    ${is_2934_active}                                       Alarms.Wait for active alarm
    ...                                                     fault_id=2934
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                     timeout=5
    Should be true                                          ${is_2934_active}
    ...                                                     msg=Fault with ID:2934 is currently not active.
    Robot Log Result                                        Fault with ID:2934 is active.

Update SW Package and Check Statuses of BTS Components when Fail Safe Mode Enabled
    [Arguments]      ${sw_download_path}
    ...              ${rmod_id_with_enabled_fail_safe_mode}
    ...              ${connection}
    ...              ${bts_type}
    ...              ${force_basic_sw}=${False}

    Priv Update SW Package and Confirm SW Compability       sw_download_path=${sw_download_path}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                     force_basic_sw=${False}

    Check Statuses of BTS Components after SW update with Impacted RMOD and Cells
    ...                                                     impacted_rmod_id=${rmod_id_with_enabled_fail_safe_mode}
    ...                                                     status_of_impacted_rmod=failed
    ...                                                     status_of_impacted_cells=failed
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

Revert Basic SW Version and Check OnAir
    [Arguments]      ${sw_download_path}
    ...              ${connection}
    ...              ${bts_type}

    ${active_sw_version}  ${passive_sw_version}             sw_update.get_active_and_passive_sw_version

    Run keyword if                                          'T1' in '${active_sw_version}' or 'T2' in '${active_sw_version}'
    ...                                                     Run keywords
    ...                                                     Robot Log Operation
    ...                                                     Reverting SW to basic version...
    ...                                                     AND
    ...                                                     Alarms.Allow X2 Link Alarms
    ...                                                     AND
    ...                                                     Priv Update SW Package and Confirm SW Compability
    ...                                                     sw_download_path=${sw_download_path}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     force_basic_sw=${True}
    ...                                                     AND
    ...                                                     Check Statuses of BTS Components after SW update
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...    ELSE                                             Run keywords
    ...                                                     Check all BBMODs RMODs and cells states for all RATs
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                     AND
    ...                                                     Verify BTS states
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                     status=OnAir
    Alarms.Disallow X2 Link Alarms

Priv Update SW Package and Confirm SW Compability
    [Arguments]      ${sw_download_path}
    ...              ${connection}
    ...              ${bts_type}
    ...              ${force_basic_sw}

    ${sw_version}  ${update_sw_target}                      Download and Update SW Package
    ...                                                     sw_download_path=${sw_download_path}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                     force_basic_sw=${force_basic_sw}

    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                             10min
    ...                                                     20sec
    ...                                                     Check if SW target version is currently uploaded
    ...                                                     sw_version=${sw_version}
    ...                                                     sw_target=${update_sw_target}

    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                             10min
    ...                                                     20sec
    ...                                                     Confirm RFSW Compability
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
